title: MrWilson
---
<<wait 0.1>>
<<if $day == 1>>
    <<jump MrWilson_Day1>>
<<elseif $day == 4>>
    <<if $hasGotFlowers == false>>
        <<jump MrWilson_Day4>>
    <<elseif $hasGotFlowers == true>>
        <<jump MrWilson_Flowers>>
    <<endif>>
<<endif>>
===

title: MrWilson_Intro
tags: intro
---
Mr Wilson: Good afternoon students! I want to give you all a warm welcome to where we'll be spending the rest of our week together. 
Mr Wilson: We'll be leaving on Friday, so I hope you can make the most of the natural scenery while you're here.
Mr Wilson: You are encouraged to explore the camp at your own leisure, however, for you own safety the forest has been made out of bounds. You are NOT to enter. 
Mr Wilson: Whaea Nyrie will be on guard at all times. 
Mr Wilson: On a lighter note, we'll hold a campfire each night where we will sing and tell stories
Mr Wilson: Now go to your assigned tents to unpack your bags. 
<<set $hasDoneIntro = true>>
<<set $day = 1>>
<<jump Ernest_Intro>>
===

title: MrWilson_Day1
---
Mr Wilson: Have fun and be safe, kids.
<<if $talkedToWilson == false>>
    <<set $talkedToWilson = true>>
    <<set $peopleMet = $peopleMet + 1>>
<<endif>>
===

title: MrWilson_Day3Prep
---
Mr Wilson: Good morning Ernest, I hope you slept well.
Mr Wilson: You're on lunch duty today. Head down to the lake to see what fish you can catch. 
Mr Wilson: There's ingredients prepared by the table to make sandwiches when you're back. 
===

title: MrWilson_Day4
---
<<set $canUseCamera = true>>
Mr Wilson: Good morning Ernest, I have a new task for you this morning. The other students have already gotten a head start since you slept in, but I'll explain it to you now. 
Mr Wilson: There's a few native flowers to be found around the camp, I don't know if you've spotted them while wandering around. 
Mr Wilson: If you find them all, you can use your camera to photograph each of them! 
Mr Wilson: Make sure you bring them back to me afterwards, I'll be questioning everyone about the names when we return to class. It's important to know the names of the native plants in our country. 
<<jump Ernest_Flowers>>
===

title: MrWilson_Flowers
---
Mr Wilson: Back so soon! Did you find them all? 
    -> Ernest: I think so.
    -> Ernest: Yes I did. 
Mr Wilson: These look wonderful, good job! I'm sure you'll ace the test, just as usual.
<<set $talkAfterFlowers = true>>
===

title: MrWilson_Day5Intro
---
Mr Wilson: I hope you all slept well on your last night in your tents. We will aim to be packed up by the afternoon, you are all on the bus by then or else you will be left behind…
Mr Wilson: …
Mr Wilson: Just kidding! We'll do a head count.
<<set $ernestThinking = true>>
===
